WEBVTT

00:00:17.410 --> 00:00:21.000
Altair: A Record of Battles

00:01:31.730 --> 00:01:35.320
Yes! Continue to crush them!

00:01:35.650 --> 00:01:36.900
That Balaban,

00:01:37.070 --> 00:01:40.580
fighting so inconsiderately
without even sending another messenger.

00:01:40.870 --> 00:01:44.330
I don't care how upset this will make him.

00:01:44.500 --> 00:01:47.080
The enemy only has 5000 soldiers.

00:01:47.290 --> 00:01:50.590
It would be faster
to take care of this without him.

00:01:51.000 --> 00:01:56.380
There is not much we can do when
the remaining 18,000 soldiers decide to attack.

00:01:56.880 --> 00:01:59.090
It will be okay, Sultan Orhan.

00:01:59.590 --> 00:02:02.140
If my padrone can take down
Sultan Balaban,

00:02:02.310 --> 00:02:05.180
the armies of the three sultanlus will collapse.

00:02:05.520 --> 00:02:08.100
Sultan, our right flank has been compromised.

00:02:08.440 --> 00:02:10.060
We will go reinforce them.

00:02:10.230 --> 00:02:13.980
No, the Orquesta must stay by the sultan
at all costs.

00:02:14.440 --> 00:02:18.360
If our commander falls,
our forces will collapse as well.

00:02:18.570 --> 00:02:22.830
Captain! We cannot hold the line
any longer!

00:02:27.080 --> 00:02:28.370
What is that?

00:02:28.580 --> 00:02:30.830
Golden horses and golden soldiers?

00:02:31.130 --> 00:02:34.050
They still had forces like that remaining.

00:02:34.210 --> 00:02:36.670
Send the left cavalry to handle these new enemies.

00:02:38.880 --> 00:02:41.050
They're the guards that were left
in the castle.

00:02:41.220 --> 00:02:43.390
Now. Reestablish our lines.

00:02:44.350 --> 00:02:46.770
Those armaments are ceremonial.

00:02:46.930 --> 00:02:49.390
They're not made to be used
in actual battle.

00:02:49.770 --> 00:02:52.560
Mahmut Bey, Uncle Beyazit.

00:02:52.770 --> 00:02:56.030
You have sworn
to ensure my uncle Balaban's death.

00:02:56.360 --> 00:02:59.280
I can at least try
to help buy you some time.

00:03:01.860 --> 00:03:03.950
Decoys? They insult us.

00:03:04.120 --> 00:03:06.370
Slaughter the wench and her men.

00:03:06.620 --> 00:03:09.370
Prenses!

00:03:19.340 --> 00:03:22.890
-Look upon this, Sultan Uzun.
-What?

00:03:23.140 --> 00:03:24.890
We have slain Sultan Balaban.

00:03:29.350 --> 00:03:31.140
Fall back! Fall back!

00:03:34.360 --> 00:03:37.150
Balaban is dead? This is not good.

00:03:37.820 --> 00:03:41.150
The Empire only offered the four sultanlus
a trade agreement

00:03:41.360 --> 00:03:44.700
because of my economic strength
and Balaban's military strength.

00:03:45.370 --> 00:03:48.580
We do not have time for pointless fighting.

00:03:48.750 --> 00:03:50.710
I need to return to Buchak,

00:03:50.910 --> 00:03:54.210
and determine our new plan with the Empire.

00:03:55.170 --> 00:03:56.880
-My brother has?
-Yes.

00:03:57.040 --> 00:04:00.130
The yenicheris have already retreated
after losing Sultan Balaban,

00:04:00.300 --> 00:04:03.260
and Sultan Uzun is also pulling back.

00:04:03.430 --> 00:04:05.970
I believe we should follow suit.

00:04:06.510 --> 00:04:08.720
Worry not, Sultan Fatma.

00:04:09.020 --> 00:04:14.230
We vow to safely deliver you
and Prens Kemal to Balta.

00:04:15.940 --> 00:04:19.480
Conclusion of the Civil War

00:04:19.730 --> 00:04:22.070
It appears they are retreating.

00:04:22.240 --> 00:04:24.990
Yes, it is just as Beyolu Ismail predicted.

00:04:25.950 --> 00:04:27.990
Prenses Aishe!

00:04:28.370 --> 00:04:31.500
Thank God. Thank God you're okay.

00:04:32.080 --> 00:04:34.040
Are you hurt?

00:04:34.210 --> 00:04:35.790
Are you in any pain?

00:04:35.960 --> 00:04:38.750
-Padrone, shall we give chase?
-No.

00:04:39.210 --> 00:04:41.260
Let us regroup first.

00:04:41.760 --> 00:04:44.050
Retreating at night in an unfamiliar land,

00:04:44.220 --> 00:04:48.260
the sultans have no choice
but to follow the path by which they came.

00:04:49.180 --> 00:04:52.390
-There is no need to actually hit them.
-I see.

00:04:52.560 --> 00:04:56.400
The sound of the shark yay firing
is sufficiently effective.

00:04:56.600 --> 00:05:00.400
This ravine will carry every little sound.

00:05:00.610 --> 00:05:05.400
I wonder how long the retreating
and demoralized troops can last.

00:05:07.030 --> 00:05:09.410
Sultan Uzun asks too much.

00:05:09.620 --> 00:05:11.450
You mean the decreases in our budget?

00:05:11.620 --> 00:05:15.210
Half of Buchak's soldiers are mercenaries after all.

00:05:15.370 --> 00:05:17.670
I just want to get some good sleep.

00:05:22.170 --> 00:05:24.130
Run!

00:05:27.800 --> 00:05:30.350
What is happening?

00:05:31.260 --> 00:05:35.600
The soldiers are rushing out of the ravine,
concerned only with self-preservation.

00:05:35.980 --> 00:05:38.190
My father is such a coward.

00:05:38.400 --> 00:05:41.110
He's nothing like your brother.

00:05:41.940 --> 00:05:44.570
While our countries may share a border,

00:05:44.740 --> 00:05:48.320
it seems what we have is vastly different.

00:05:48.490 --> 00:05:51.620
You and your brother
may have had your differences...

00:05:52.490 --> 00:05:57.370
But I don't think I could even recognize
my own siblings' faces.

00:05:57.790 --> 00:06:00.420
As soon as a Beyolu is born in Buchak,

00:06:00.590 --> 00:06:05.130
they are taken to different companies
and raised as strangers.

00:06:05.800 --> 00:06:07.880
And when the sultan dies,

00:06:08.090 --> 00:06:12.100
the child who's fastest to sit upon the throne

00:06:12.260 --> 00:06:14.680
becomes the next sultan.

00:06:15.020 --> 00:06:16.390
Since the moment we were born,

00:06:16.560 --> 00:06:20.610
our thoughts have been only
about outmaneuvering each other

00:06:20.770 --> 00:06:22.900
to take the throne for ourselves.

00:06:23.610 --> 00:06:27.740
It looks like backing you was the right decision.

00:06:34.290 --> 00:06:36.500
The sound has stopped.

00:06:38.120 --> 00:06:39.750
Father!

00:06:39.960 --> 00:06:41.040
Where are you?

00:06:41.210 --> 00:06:43.250
Please respond if you're here. Father!

00:06:43.790 --> 00:06:45.340
Father!

00:06:45.500 --> 00:06:48.970
Beyolu Ismail has arrived.

00:06:49.130 --> 00:06:51.470
Oh, I am glad to see you.

00:06:51.640 --> 00:06:54.010
But what are you doing here?

00:06:54.390 --> 00:06:57.560
I had a favor to ask of you, Father,

00:06:57.730 --> 00:06:59.520
so I followed after you.

00:06:59.890 --> 00:07:01.150
What is it, then?

00:07:01.310 --> 00:07:05.020
Go on. I will give you anything
as long as we're able to make it out safely.

00:07:05.230 --> 00:07:07.230
Father.

00:07:08.150 --> 00:07:11.570
It is time for you to die.

00:07:11.740 --> 00:07:14.780
I will be taking over from here.

00:07:16.700 --> 00:07:18.620
Now is our chance to make it out of the ravine.

00:07:18.910 --> 00:07:20.210
Pick up the pace.

00:07:23.080 --> 00:07:24.750
It's the Kuluch forces.

00:07:25.000 --> 00:07:26.960
Hurry! Don't let them catch up to us!

00:07:31.130 --> 00:07:32.260
Sultan Fatma!

00:07:32.430 --> 00:07:35.220
-Help them.
-Are you okay?

00:07:40.560 --> 00:07:43.900
I must ask you to die as well, Mother.

00:07:44.060 --> 00:07:46.270
Kuluch Sultanlu
Acapyip, Indigo Palace

00:07:46.900 --> 00:07:50.700
Please remain here until we finish negotiations.

00:07:51.740 --> 00:07:54.950
This is all unnecessary.

00:07:55.410 --> 00:08:00.710
My life ended when my brother died.

00:08:02.250 --> 00:08:06.670
Traitors against Birlik Torqye are executed.

00:08:06.840 --> 00:08:09.960
My mother will have to die.
There is no other way.

00:08:10.800 --> 00:08:13.340
What about the child?

00:08:13.470 --> 00:08:16.510
I'm talking about who is going to be the heir
of Balta's throne.

00:08:16.680 --> 00:08:20.980
Yes, succession in the Balta Sultanlu
is generally through the male heirs.

00:08:21.390 --> 00:08:23.390
As long as that prens is alive,

00:08:23.560 --> 00:08:26.230
you will not be able
to inherit the throne, prenses.

00:08:26.440 --> 00:08:30.990
Actually, why did they bring such a little kid
to the battlefield anyway?

00:08:31.650 --> 00:08:36.280
Because they could not leave him alone
in the Baltan palace.

00:08:36.450 --> 00:08:39.990
To us, that palace is no different from a battlefield.

00:08:41.540 --> 00:08:44.330
Four years ago, my father, the previous sultan,

00:08:44.500 --> 00:08:46.420
fell ill and died.

00:08:46.580 --> 00:08:49.750
In accordance with his will, my mother would rule

00:08:49.960 --> 00:08:51.880
until my younger brother came of age.

00:08:52.550 --> 00:08:54.720
However, my father's relatives were unhappy

00:08:54.880 --> 00:08:59.140
that a woman from Muzrak would reign
as the sultan of Balta,

00:08:59.390 --> 00:09:04.560
and they tried to kill my mother,
my brother and myself

00:09:04.730 --> 00:09:07.940
in order to make my father's younger brother,
Cassim, the next sultan.

00:09:08.690 --> 00:09:14.110
And it was my uncle Balaban
who came to our rescue.

00:09:15.650 --> 00:09:18.280
Shortly thereafter, Cassim died.

00:09:18.660 --> 00:09:23.000
However, my uncle spared those
who supported Cassim

00:09:24.080 --> 00:09:29.540
in order to ensure my mother
would not be able to live without him

00:09:30.170 --> 00:09:35.260
and to ensure that Balta
could never betray Muzrak.

00:09:35.760 --> 00:09:37.260
I see.

00:09:37.680 --> 00:09:39.010
Wait!

00:09:39.180 --> 00:09:43.180
Then that means Sultan Fatma
was nothing more than Balaban's victim.

00:09:43.350 --> 00:09:45.020
There is no reason to kill her.

00:09:45.230 --> 00:09:48.020
She must be put to death.

00:09:48.480 --> 00:09:52.780
Even if she does not wish it,
those in power who revolt against Torqye

00:09:52.940 --> 00:09:57.030
will be made into the figureheads
of future rebellions.

00:09:59.240 --> 00:10:02.740
Sultan of Balta, Nilufer Fatma,

00:10:02.910 --> 00:10:06.620
you will be executed at sundown.

00:10:07.040 --> 00:10:10.130
The means of your execution will be poison.

00:10:10.290 --> 00:10:12.500
The poison will kill you instantly.

00:10:12.800 --> 00:10:14.670
You will not feel any pain.

00:10:14.840 --> 00:10:15.840
I understand.

00:10:17.220 --> 00:10:21.100
This child, will Kemal be executed, as well?

00:10:21.510 --> 00:10:25.310
Torqyean law will not require him to be punished.

00:10:25.470 --> 00:10:29.690
We will have Prens Kemal inherit Balta's throne.

00:10:31.520 --> 00:10:33.690
Please do not worry, Sultan Fatma.

00:10:34.320 --> 00:10:37.490
Torqye will eliminate all of the prens' enemies.

00:10:37.650 --> 00:10:39.950
We will not allow any harm to come to him.

00:10:40.110 --> 00:10:43.620
And until the prens comes of age
on his 15th birthday,

00:10:43.780 --> 00:10:47.160
the prenses will serve in his stead.

00:10:47.790 --> 00:10:49.960
Do you agree to this, Prenses Aishe?

00:10:50.120 --> 00:10:51.540
Of course.

00:10:51.670 --> 00:10:53.000
I vow to raise Kemal

00:10:53.170 --> 00:10:58.220
to become a great sultan capable
of making decisions he can be proud of.

00:11:03.260 --> 00:11:05.850
Please wait! Sister! No!

00:11:07.140 --> 00:11:09.350
Please don't kill Mother!

00:11:09.560 --> 00:11:12.270
Mother has done nothing wrong.

00:11:12.440 --> 00:11:14.360
Sister! Please ask them to spare her!

00:11:15.610 --> 00:11:17.940
I cannot do that.

00:11:18.110 --> 00:11:24.030
Orhan and Uncle Beyazit both had to take the lives
of those they loved.

00:11:24.200 --> 00:11:29.370
So how could I ask to be the exception,
and have my mother spared?

00:11:31.000 --> 00:11:34.630
Mother knew what Uncle Balaban was doing.

00:11:34.790 --> 00:11:36.880
She is not entirely blameless.

00:11:37.050 --> 00:11:40.670
-Sister!
-It is all right, Kemal.

00:11:41.300 --> 00:11:46.060
My life was extended only because of my brother.

00:11:46.260 --> 00:11:50.890
I complied with my brother
in order to survive in that palace,

00:11:51.100 --> 00:11:55.400
knowing full well
that would spur my brother's ambitions.

00:11:55.900 --> 00:11:59.400
Therefore, it is only right
that I die alongside my brother.

00:11:59.610 --> 00:12:01.610
I don't care! I don't care about any of that!

00:12:02.150 --> 00:12:07.080
If you kill my mother, Sister,
I will never forgive you!

00:12:25.680 --> 00:12:29.560
Please take good care of Kemal.

00:12:58.840 --> 00:13:01.840
I hereby declare the execution fulfilled.

00:13:05.090 --> 00:13:08.350
You are not executing Sultan Fatma?

00:13:08.600 --> 00:13:10.310
Mahmut Bey!

00:13:10.470 --> 00:13:16.060
Prens Kemal is not like those of you
who made the choice to kill your own blood.

00:13:16.350 --> 00:13:18.360
If his mother's like is taken

00:13:18.560 --> 00:13:22.320
because of some decision made by people
unknown to him in some distant place,

00:13:22.650 --> 00:13:26.610
he will never forgive us.

00:13:26.950 --> 00:13:28.200
If that happens,

00:13:28.410 --> 00:13:32.620
the unity among the four sultanlus
that we have fought to achieve would be undone.

00:13:33.410 --> 00:13:37.790
We will prepare a home for you here
in the outskirts of Acayip.

00:13:37.960 --> 00:13:43.300
You will be free to meet with the prens
and prenses as you please.

00:13:47.630 --> 00:13:49.050
Hold on, Mahmut.

00:13:49.220 --> 00:13:52.390
There was definitely a secret deal
between the four sultanlus and the Empire.

00:13:53.020 --> 00:13:57.390
Do you think the Divan
would allow Sultan Fatma to be spared?

00:13:57.810 --> 00:14:02.520
Dethrone the four sultans
and overthrow their governments.

00:14:02.690 --> 00:14:05.070
That is what they ordered me to do.

00:14:05.240 --> 00:14:09.370
And I am the one who deserves recognition
for this feat.

00:14:09.570 --> 00:14:13.290
I will not allow even the Divan to intervene

00:14:13.580 --> 00:14:16.330
with how I decide to handle the sultans.

00:14:33.560 --> 00:14:38.100
So you really do have to leave, prenses...

00:14:39.600 --> 00:14:40.730
Poor thing.

00:14:40.900 --> 00:14:43.610
He was so close to sealing the deal.

00:14:44.070 --> 00:14:49.530
Please take care of yourself.

00:14:50.950 --> 00:14:52.990
Stop crying.

00:14:53.160 --> 00:14:57.000
I will be coming back to marry you soon enough.

00:14:57.160 --> 00:15:00.120
You had better not be such a crybaby
when I return.

00:15:00.620 --> 00:15:01.670
I won't be.

00:15:09.170 --> 00:15:12.550
Torqyean Year 75, September 1st.

00:15:13.100 --> 00:15:16.600
The four sultanlus' rebellion was put to an end.

00:15:20.140 --> 00:15:22.690
News of this would reach the 13 pashas

00:15:23.900 --> 00:15:29.400
on their way to attack the capitals of Buchak,
Balta and Muzrak

00:15:29.570 --> 00:15:31.700
that very afternoon.

00:15:32.570 --> 00:15:36.700
The pashas remained outside the city,
awaiting the arrival of the new sultans,

00:15:36.950 --> 00:15:41.250
and entered the capitals together.

00:15:41.830 --> 00:15:46.380
And so the birth of a new Torqyean regime
instituted by the four sultanlus

00:15:46.550 --> 00:15:47.920
was announced to all,

00:15:48.090 --> 00:15:53.970
establishing the Birlik Torqye union
for the first time in 12 years.

00:15:56.430 --> 00:16:00.980
The sultanlus' civil war was merely
a family squabble that resulted

00:16:01.730 --> 00:16:04.610
in the weakening of the Birlik Torqye forces

00:16:04.770 --> 00:16:07.730
without any cost to our own.

00:16:08.570 --> 00:16:14.700
Torqye could be easily taken now,
Your Imperial Highness.

00:16:15.120 --> 00:16:18.700
When the wheat from Tharros arrives
in the fall,

00:16:18.870 --> 00:16:23.420
I believe we should move to invade Torqye.

00:16:24.790 --> 00:16:27.290
Altu is truly a sight to behold.

00:16:27.460 --> 00:16:29.760
Look at all those market tents.

00:16:30.420 --> 00:16:34.510
I hope Mahmut Bey gets reinstated as pasha
without trouble.

00:16:35.140 --> 00:16:38.220
The padrone earned the most recognition
from this operation.

00:16:38.390 --> 00:16:42.020
Getting reinstated as pasha would be common sense.

00:16:42.850 --> 00:16:46.610
I'm worried
because there's never been a precedent

00:16:46.770 --> 00:16:48.770
of a politician having common sense.

00:16:49.480 --> 00:16:51.740
Tughril Mahmut Bey.

00:16:51.900 --> 00:16:56.280
The Divan acknowledges your report.

00:16:56.490 --> 00:16:58.280
Your work is to be commended.

00:17:03.210 --> 00:17:06.920
There is one final question
I would like to ask of you.

00:17:07.710 --> 00:17:13.130
Do you still wish to return
to being a pasha of Torqye, Mahmut Bey?

00:17:14.800 --> 00:17:16.470
I am being questioned.

00:17:16.970 --> 00:17:20.720
They want to know where my loyalties
with Torqye lie.

00:17:21.520 --> 00:17:22.980
But...

00:17:23.480 --> 00:17:25.730
That was impeccably done, Mahmut Bey.

00:17:26.270 --> 00:17:28.480
One unexpected turn after another.

00:17:28.650 --> 00:17:33.650
You managed to achieve a miraculous victory
when the odds were stacked against us.

00:17:33.940 --> 00:17:34.990
However,

00:17:35.950 --> 00:17:39.030
needless blood was spilled.

00:17:40.780 --> 00:17:45.750
Those are the comments of a pacifist.

00:17:45.910 --> 00:17:49.040
But you have the qualities to command a battlefield.

00:17:49.750 --> 00:17:51.550
What do you mean?

00:17:51.800 --> 00:17:55.670
You are afraid of people dying for peace.

00:17:55.840 --> 00:17:57.680
But I ask you to reflect for a moment.

00:17:57.840 --> 00:18:00.510
Did you ever once feel afraid of the enemy
in this fight?

00:18:00.680 --> 00:18:04.430
Or afraid for your own life?

00:18:05.100 --> 00:18:07.690
If they know what purpose they fight for,

00:18:07.850 --> 00:18:10.190
soldiers can die happy.

00:18:10.360 --> 00:18:13.860
You have the ability to show soldiers
that purpose and to lead them.

00:18:14.030 --> 00:18:15.820
Although you may be reluctant to.

00:18:16.150 --> 00:18:17.150
As it stands,

00:18:17.360 --> 00:18:21.830
we sultans will happily risk our lives
for you in the coming future.

00:18:24.040 --> 00:18:26.250
I appreciate the sentiment.

00:18:26.410 --> 00:18:31.750
But I wholeheartedly believe
that it is my place and duty

00:18:31.920 --> 00:18:33.840
to work tirelessly to the end

00:18:34.420 --> 00:18:36.800
so it may never come to that.

00:18:39.930 --> 00:18:42.260
I do feel anger towards the Divan.

00:18:42.430 --> 00:18:43.850
But even so...

00:18:44.390 --> 00:18:46.560
I wish to be reinstated as pasha.

00:18:46.730 --> 00:18:50.850
I still have many things
I wish to do as part of the Divan.

00:18:51.440 --> 00:18:52.610
As pasha,

00:18:52.810 --> 00:18:56.860
I will attempt to fulfill my mission
through the political process.

00:18:57.320 --> 00:18:58.860
Understood.

00:18:59.030 --> 00:19:03.370
Let the kayuts show
Mahmut Bey has been promoted to pasha.

00:19:03.780 --> 00:19:06.620
You will be permitted
to attend future Divan councils as pasha

00:19:06.790 --> 00:19:09.620
beginning this afternoon.

00:19:11.000 --> 00:19:16.300
Birlik Torqye lost an estimated 7000 soldiers
in the recent civil strife.

00:19:16.460 --> 00:19:19.260
The Empire will surely strike before long.

00:19:19.420 --> 00:19:21.680
How shall we meet our enemy then?

00:19:22.470 --> 00:19:24.760
I have a suggestion.

00:19:25.220 --> 00:19:26.430
What is it?

00:19:26.930 --> 00:19:29.690
We launch a preemptive attack.

00:19:29.890 --> 00:19:31.520
A preemptive attack?

00:19:31.850 --> 00:19:33.480
That is madness.

00:19:33.650 --> 00:19:38.280
No nation has ever launched an invasion
against the Empire in its entire history.

00:19:38.440 --> 00:19:40.860
We do not have the forces for such an expedition

00:19:41.030 --> 00:19:42.910
so soon after suffering such a blow.

00:19:43.530 --> 00:19:47.660
Power is not derived solely from military strength.

00:19:47.830 --> 00:19:52.120
We have a weapon that has provided 75 years
of prosperity to our nation.

00:19:52.670 --> 00:19:55.130
Our economic strength.

00:19:55.590 --> 00:19:57.750
Of all the things he could have said.

00:19:58.380 --> 00:20:01.260
I approve of making the first strike
against the Empire.

00:20:01.510 --> 00:20:04.180
Be that as it may,

00:20:04.720 --> 00:20:09.180
we do not currently have the man power
to take on such an operation.

00:20:09.310 --> 00:20:12.810
However, there is one person
who was just made pasha

00:20:12.980 --> 00:20:16.820
and is without any assigned role.

00:20:17.320 --> 00:20:18.480
In Torqye,

00:20:18.650 --> 00:20:21.780
there are nearly 100 pashas
spread across many divisions

00:20:21.950 --> 00:20:24.700
building political experience.

00:20:25.120 --> 00:20:26.700
But there is no division currently

00:20:26.870 --> 00:20:30.830
that specializes in strategies not reliant
on military action as Mahmut describes.

00:20:31.000 --> 00:20:33.420
So, what do you think about creating such a division

00:20:33.580 --> 00:20:36.460
and leaving him in charge of it?

00:20:37.000 --> 00:20:40.510
Why don't we show those Imperials
that they're not always the ones

00:20:40.670 --> 00:20:42.470
to make the first move?

00:20:44.840 --> 00:20:47.430
Returning to his first Divan in five months,

00:20:47.600 --> 00:20:54.230
Tughril Mahmut Pasha was made the first
minister of foreign affairs before the day's end.

00:21:02.570 --> 00:21:04.820
If they know what purpose they fight for,

00:21:04.990 --> 00:21:07.280
soldiers will die happy.

00:21:07.450 --> 00:21:09.240
Someone told me that.

00:21:10.200 --> 00:21:11.910
Zaganos Pasha.

00:21:12.080 --> 00:21:15.120
The reason you use men like me
and Suleyman Bey

00:21:15.580 --> 00:21:19.420
is because we are those type of men.

00:21:19.670 --> 00:21:21.300
Isn't it?

00:21:22.550 --> 00:21:27.180
In that case,
I would have to say you have a keen eye.

00:21:29.550 --> 00:21:31.430
Well, listen to you now.

00:21:35.850 --> 00:21:37.190
I am returning this.

00:21:37.600 --> 00:21:41.730
I am a pasha like you now.

00:21:42.110 --> 00:21:43.360
Do not be conceited.

00:21:43.530 --> 00:21:47.820
What sane pasha would relinquish control
of a useful tool?

00:21:48.410 --> 00:21:49.830
You're a great orator.

00:21:50.240 --> 00:21:53.080
Now it's time to provide results.

00:22:00.210 --> 00:22:03.090
Well, well. It suits you.

00:22:03.710 --> 00:22:07.510
That took some time.

00:22:07.680 --> 00:22:10.680
Well, shall we move on to the next job,

00:22:11.470 --> 00:22:14.220
Mahmut Pasha?

00:23:48.070 --> 00:23:50.280
A business that moves the world?

00:23:51.030 --> 00:23:52.780
You're not tricking me that easily.

00:23:52.950 --> 00:23:54.990
I'm the daughter of a merchant,
I'll have you know.

00:23:55.780 --> 00:23:58.080
Next time, "The Caravan Daughter."

00:23:58.370 --> 00:24:00.870
A world I've never seen?
